OL,3,GNEWSAAll special schools in Northern
OL,4,AIreland full, says EA
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll special schools in Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fare full and in some pupil numbers have
OL,8,Fdoubled in the past decade.
OL,10,FThat is according to an operational
OL,11,Fplan for 2026/27 published by the
OL,12,FEducation Authority (EA).
OL,14,FBut it also said that due to falling
OL,15,Fbirth rates, fewer primary and
OL,16,Fpost-primary schools will be needed in
OL,17,Ffuture years.
OL,19,FThat could lead to further closures of
OL,20,Fsmall schools with relatively small
OL,21,Fnumbers of pupils.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
